  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Camping Côté Mer is part of the Marvilla Parks group, in Mandelieu-la-Napoule, between Cannes and the Estérel.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The dog policy is published directly on the official Marvilla Parks group page ("Our dog-friendly campsites"): one small dog is accepted per rental pitch, for a surcharge of 6€/day in the Classic or Comfort range, and 8€/day in Premium or Ultimate. This is an official statement from the operator, a good level of confirmation.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: check the size limit carefully before booking a rental accommodation, the rule is stricter than for a simple camping pitch.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Estérel massif, with its coastal trails, is a few minutes away by car to extend the stay.</p>
    </div>

